{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_215_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_215","textTraditional":"一、三年。春王正月，公如晉，至河乃復。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_215_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_215","textTraditional":"二、三月辛卯，邾婁子穿卒。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_215_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_215","textTraditional":"三、夏四月。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_215_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_215","textTraditional":"四、秋，葬邾婁莊公。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_215_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_215","textTraditional":"五、冬，仲孫何忌及邾婁子盟于枝。","sentenceOrder":5}],"overrides":{}}